---
<section id="conversion" class="section section-bg-gray" style="padding: 3rem 0;">
  <div class="container flex flex-col items-center">
    <div class="flex justify-center items-center" style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
      <h2 class="text-2xl" style="font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.05em; color: var(--color-primary); margin: 0; text-transform: uppercase;">
        CONVERSION
      </h2>
    </div>
    <h3 class="text-2xl text-muted" style="margin-bottom: 2.5rem; text-align: center;">START WITH A REQUIREMENT.</h3>

    <div class="grid grid-2 gap-4 w-100" style="width: 100%;">
      <div class="card flex flex-col gap-2" style="height: 100%; padding: 1.5rem;">
        <div class="img-box" style="aspect-ratio: 3/1; margin-bottom: 1rem; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); padding: 0; overflow: hidden;">
          <img src="https://www.hy-techengineers.com/images/main-slider/image-1b.png" alt="Product Range" style="width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover;" />
        </div>
        <span class="text-xs text-muted">FOR PROCUREMENT & REPEAT BUYERS</span>
        <h3 class="text-xl text-primary">FIND THE RIGHT PRODUCT.</h3>
        <p class="text-sm" style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">Explore HIDROPEX's hydraulic fitting range across DIN, JIC, ORFS, conversion and other connection systems.</p>
        <a href="/products" class="btn btn-navy" style="background: var(--color-navy-dark); color: white; width: 100%; margin-top: auto;">EXPLORE PRODUCTS ↗</a>
      </div>

      <div class="card flex flex-col gap-2" style="height: 100%; padding: 1.5rem;">
        <div class="img-box" style="aspect-ratio: 3/1; margin-bottom: 1rem; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); padding: 0; overflow: hidden;">
          <img src="https://www.hidropex.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/DSC02733-640x400.jpg" alt="Engineering OEM" style="width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover;" />
        </div>
        <span class="text-xs text-muted">FOR OEM & ENGINEERING TEAMS</span>
        <h3 class="text-xl text-primary">DEVELOP THE RIGHT CONNECTION.</h3>
        <p class="text-sm" style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">Bring us your application requirement, drawing or specification. Our engineering and manufacturing capabilities support development from prototype to production.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-navy" style="background: var(--color-navy-dark); color: white; width: 100%; margin-top: auto;">REQUEST A QUOTE ↗</a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
